@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Search by ticker or name
GET {{baseUrl}}/instruments?query=banco

### Accents and case are ignored: finds "Compañía Introductora..."
GET {{baseUrl}}/instruments?query=compania

### Pages: 2 results per page, second page (size is capped at 100)
GET {{baseUrl}}/instruments?query=banco&size=2&page=1

### A blank query is rejected (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/instruments?query=%20
